THIRD-PARTY NOTICE — MODEL WEIGHTS ARE NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the source code in this repository only. It does NOT cover
the pretrained face-recognition models the pipeline downloads at runtime.

InsightFace's pretrained models, including the `buffalo_l` pack used here
(RetinaFace `det_10g` + ArcFace `w600k_r50`), are released by their authors for
NON-COMMERCIAL RESEARCH PURPOSES ONLY. This project is a non-commercial
research and hackathon artefact and falls within that grant. Any commercial use
would require different models or a separate licence from the InsightFace
authors.

Fixture images under `data/fixtures/` are Wikimedia Commons photographs of
public figures, each under its own licence; see `data/fixtures/SOURCES.md`.

See README.md ("Licensing") and ETHICS.md for the full statement.
